Package: hfareport
Type: Package
Title: Health Facility Assessment Summary Reports from REDCap Exports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Morris", "Ogero", email = "ogeromorris@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Rebecca", "Penzias", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Developed the original Stata data-cleaning code on which hfa_clean() is based"),
    person("Eric", "Ohuma", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Developed the original Stata data-cleaning code on which hfa_clean() is based"))
Description: Turns the module exports of a neonatal Health Facility
    Assessment (HFA) collected in REDCap into one cleaned summary dataset,
    then fills a bookmarked Microsoft Word template to produce one summary
    report per facility. Cells are colour-coded against configurable rules so
    that gaps stand out, and reports remain fully editable Word documents.
